 "description": "<p>Five pieces in airline blue polyester: hat, scarf, top, short skirt, and thong, one size for 40-60 kg. The full uniform count is what separates this listing from the four-piece versions - the scarf is the fifth piece, and it is the one that sells the fantasy.</p>\n<p>Each piece has a job: hat for the instant read, scarf for the formality, top and skirt for the silhouette, thong to complete. Polyester keeps the collar and pleats crisp without ironing anxiety.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: polyester</li>\n<li>Includes: hat, scarf, top, short skirt, thong</li>\n<li>Style: flight attendant</li>\n<li>Color: blue</li>\n<li>Sizing: one size, recommended 40-60 kg</li>\n</ul>\n<p>One size for 40-60 kg. The most complete flight attendant set on the site.</p>\n",
